<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka Pegasus announces bonus issue.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka Pegasus announces bonus issue.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pegasus Hotels of Ceylon Ltd announced a three-for-five bonus issue on Thursday, the company said.</p>
<p>After the issue, the issued capital of the company would rise to 7.12 million shares from 4.45 million.</p>
<p>The share last traded at 9.50 rupees a 10-rupee share on July 16. ($1 = 58.7 rupees) --- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
